meta {
  name: 1. List All Trades
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/trades?limit=50&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  limit: 50
  offset: 0
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # List All Trades

  Returns paginated list of all completed trades (history).

  ## Security:
  - Requires JWT authentication
  - Shows all trades in the system (public history)

  ## Query Parameters:
  - `limit`: Number of results (default: 50)
  - `offset`: Pagination offset (default: 0)

  ## Response:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "offer_id": 1,
        "creator_id": 2,
        "creator_email": "user2@example.com",
        "acceptor_id": 1,
        "acceptor_email": "user1@example.com",
        "skin_offered_id": 5,
        "skin_requested_id": 3,
        "completed_at": "2025-11-16T10:30:00Z",
        "skin_offered": {
          "id": 5,
          "name": "AWP | Dragon Lore",
          "market_price": 4500.00
        },
        "skin_requested": {
          "id": 3,
          "name": "M4A4 | Howl",
          "market_price": 4200.00
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Use Cases:
  - Audit trail of all trades
  - Market analysis
  - Trade transparency
}
